---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Justices" current="/justices">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;padding-top:32px;padding-bottom:60px">
    <div class="section-head"><h2>The Justices</h2></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The Supreme Court of Fantasy Football consists of the League sitting en banc. Every member of the League is a Justice, except the Commissioner, who is a party, and the Clerk, who is a trash bin.</p>
      <p>There is no Chief Justice. Seniority is determined by draft position, which is itself the subject of pending litigation.</p>
      <p>The Court's composition will be published upon confirmation of the roster. Justices are not required to have read the briefs, attended argument, or set their lineups.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
